{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4286560","formula":"C₈H₁₄N₄O₂","hill":"C8H14N4O2","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":8.0,"H":14.0,"N":4.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Mebicar","ru":"Мебикар","uk":"Мебікар"},"descriptions":{"en":"Temgicoluril (INNTooltip International Nonproprietary Name), also known as tetramethylglycoluril and sold under the brand names Adaptol and Mebicar, is an anxiolytic medication produced by Latvian pharmaceutical company Olainfarm and sold in Latvia and Russia. The chemical structure of temgicoluril is somewhat similar to uric acid and it doesn't interact with acids, alkali, oxidants and reducing agents. It seems to affect all major neurotransmitter systems.","ru":"Тетраметилтетраазабициклооктандион (Адаптол, Мебикар, Мебикс) — лекарственный препарат, «дневной» транквилизатор.","uk":"ТЕМГІКОЛУРИЛ (МНН: TEMGICOLURILUM (ТЕМГІКОЛУРИЛ); Адаптол (Adaptol), Мебікар, лат. Mebicarum) — синтетичний препарат, що за хімічним складом є похідним біциклічної біссечовини, та належить до групи транквілізаторів (анксіолітиків). Мебікар застосовується перорально."},"fame":5,"pubchemCid":122282,"mass":198.22,"charge":0,"smiles":"CN1C2C(N(C1=O)C)N(C(=O)N2C)C","inchikey":"XIUUSFJTJXFNGH-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1,3,4,6-tetramethyl-3a,6a-dihydroimidazo[4,5-d]imidazole-2,5-dione","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"122282","atoms":28,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-3.022,"y":0.317,"z":0.855,"el":"O"},{"x":3.023,"y":-0.317,"z":0.854,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.392,"y":-0.984,"z":-0.231,"el":"N"},{"x":-1.057,"y":1.242,"z":-0.051,"el":"N"},{"x":1.058,"y":-1.242,"z":-0.052,"el":"N"},{"x":1.393,"y":0.984,"z":-0.232,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.084,"y":-0.767,"z":-0.822,"el":"C"},{"x":0.084,"y":0.767,"z":-0.822,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.951,"y":0.204,"z":0.271,"el":"C"},{"x":1.952,